        "original_id": "8a00a716-60ce-516f-8efc-9058cd64d68d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Arundel Castle\n- Events: English Civil War\n- Topics: Restoration of historic buildings, England's government\n\nFacts:\n- The English Civil War lasted from 1642 to 1651.\n- The English Civil War was a series of armed conflicts and political machinations between Parliamentarians, also called Roundheads, and Royalists, also called Cavaliers, mainly over the manner of England's government.\n- Arundel Castle was damaged during the English Civil War.\n- Arundel Castle was restored in the 18th and 19th centuries.",
